PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786187925
OL,3,CMan jailed for life over murder of
OL,4,Csister's boyfriend in New Year's Eve
OL,5,Cstabbing
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Police officers
OL,8,Fwere called to Murray's home on Tarn
OL,9,FDrive in Prestwich at around 11:56pm
OL,10,Fto reports of a disturbance, and
OL,11,Fdiscovered Joe unresponsive and
OL,12,Fbleeding at the bottom of a staircase.
OL,14,FJoe was pronounced dead at the scene
OL,15,Fat 12:43am on New Year's Day, with a
OL,16,Fpost-mortem later confirming he died
OL,17,Fof a single stab wound to the back.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786187925
OL,3,CMan jailed for life over murder of
OL,4,Csister's boyfriend in New Year's Eve
OL,5,Cstabbing
OL,7,FAt the scene, Murray denied any
OL,8,Finvolvement and instead told police he
OL,9,Fhad been at the pub and found Joe at
OL,10,Fthe bottom of his stairs.
OL,12,FBut phone and location data told a
OL,13,Fdifferent story. Investigators quickly
OL,14,Fproved Murray had been at home all
OL,15,Fevening with his sister, Joe, and one
OL,16,Fother person.
OL,18,FFootage recovered from internal CCTV
OL,19,Fand mobile phones also captured the
OL,20,Fmoments leading up to the attack as
OL,21,Fwell as the attack itself.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786187925
OL,3,CMan jailed for life over murder of
OL,4,Csister's boyfriend in New Year's Eve
OL,5,Cstabbing
OL,7,FThe footage showed Murray putting Joe
OL,8,Fin a headlock before stabbing him in
OL,9,Fthe back.
OL,11,FThis evidence led to Murray being
OL,12,Fcharged with murder and later found
OL,13,Fguilty at court. On Friday 7 August
OL,14,F2026 he was sentenced to life
OL,15,Fimprisonment with a minimum of 18
OL,16,Fyears.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
