FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786187925
OL,3,CMan jailed for life over murder of
OL,4,Csister's boyfriend in New Year's Eve
OL,5,Cstabbing
OL,7,FDuncan Thorpe, the Senior
OL,8,FInvestigating Officer, said: "First
OL,9,Fand foremost, our thoughts remain with
OL,10,FJoe's family and friends at this
OL,11,Fincredibly difficult time. He
OL,12,Ftragically lost his life in a
OL,13,Fsenseless act of violence.
OL,15,F"Murray carried out a brutal attack on
OL,16,FJoe and then attempted to mislead
OL,17,Fofficers about his involvement.
OL,26,@pD@^OUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786187925
OL,3,CMan jailed for life over murder of
OL,4,Csister's boyfriend in New Year's Eve
OL,5,Cstabbing
OL,7,F"Thanks to the thorough and diligent
OL,8,Fwork of the investigation team, we
OL,9,Fwere able to piece together the
OL,10,Fevidence and ensure he faced justice.
OL,12,F"While no sentence can ever make up
OL,13,Ffor the loss of Joe, we hope today's
OL,14,Foutcome brings some closure to those
OL,15,Fwho knew and loved him."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@XO]
